OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to popular
OL,4,AMcDonald's worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to a
OL,7,F"well-loved" member of staff at a
OL,8,FSheffield branch of McDonald's,
OL,9,Ffollowing his death aged 41
OL,11,FCraig Baker, who had worked at
OL,12,FMcDonald's in Meadowhall for more than
OL,13,F20 years, died on Sunday, his family
OL,14,Fconfirmed.
OL,16,FTributes have flooded in on social
OL,17,Fmedia for the front-of-house team
OL,18,Fmember, who was highly commended in the
OL,19,FTrue Star category at Meadowhall's
OL,20,Fannual awards last year.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
