OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid to popular
OL,4,AMcDonald's worker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Meadowhall spokesperson said:
OL,7,F"Everyone at Meadowhall is sorry to
OL,8,Fhear of the loss of Craig, a well-loved
OL,9,Fmember of the McDonald's team. Our
OL,10,Fthoughts and deepest sympathies are
OL,11,Fwith his family, friends and
OL,12,Fcolleagues."
